  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1748509466_7244045_99da826871cb167fc7e6c2ec38904f1f.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Luxsanat is a wellness technology company bringing together neuroscience, light therapy, and modern design.</span></h3><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Our main products — </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>NeuroVizr</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"> (brain engagement device) and </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>FlexBeam</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"> (red light therapy device) — help people improve focus, recovery, sleep, and overall mental balance through safe, science-based stimulation.</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong> What makes us different:</strong></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We don’t sell gadgets — we sell </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>transformative experiences</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">.</span></h3><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-size:12px;\">Luxsanat represents the </span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>next generation of wellness</strong></span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-size:12px;\">, combining </span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>scientific innovation, artistic design, and emotional storytelling</strong></span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-size:12px;\">.</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Our products are trusted by </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>athletes, creatives, and business leaders</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"> across the world who seek deeper mental fitness and recovery.</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong> How affiliates can earn:</strong></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Affiliates earn </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>up to 11% commission</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"> on every sale generated through their unique referral link or code.</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Payouts are made </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>after a 30-day return period</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">, within </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>2 weeks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"> following that.</span></p><p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-size:12px;\">You’ll also receive access to </span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>exclusive offers, launch campaigns, and content support</strong></span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-size:12px;\">.</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong> How to promote us:</strong></span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Promote Luxsanat by sharing your </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>personal experience</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">, product photos, or </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>short videos</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"> that show how NeuroVizr™ or FlexBeam support focus, energy, or relaxation.</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We recommend authentic storytelling, social media posts, email newsletters, or collaboration with like-minded wellness and fitness communities.</span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>Other information:</strong></span></p><p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-size:12px;\">Our team provides affiliates with </span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>marketing materials, visuals, and regular campaign updates</strong></span><span class=\"s3\" style=\"font-size:12px;\">.</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">We encourage long-term partnerships built on </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>trust, creativity, and results</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">.</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">For support, contact us anytime at </span><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>info@luxsanat.com</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">.</span></p></div></div>",
